'''Kyosaka Nanaho''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]] and can be unlocked at an extremely low chance when playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror]] event.

