==Existence Elsewhere==
===[[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou]]===
Kyosaka Nanaho was an obtainable unit in YuruGeGe during the YuruGeGe x [[Kyoutou Project]] collabs, the second of which also added a summer version of her.

{{Gallery|Uni544 f00}}

==Trivia==
*Despite being in the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|GirlsMons]] set, Nanaho comes from the discontinued [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] game "''[[Kyoutou Project]]''".
**The "other world that has perished" in True Kyosaka Nanaho's Japanese description is referring to it, as the game's discontinuation was announced not long before Nanaho was added to [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]].
*The two yellow-eyed cats beside Kyosaka Nanaho are ''[[wikipedia:Nekomata|nekomata]]'', which were among the most commonly seen ''yōkai'' in Kyoutou Project.

